---
---

<section id="team" class="py-16 md:py-24 border-b border-[#1a2233]">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
    <div class="mb-12">
      <div class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mono text-[#22c55e] mb-2">
        Đội Ngũ Kỹ Sư Cốt Lõi
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight mb-4">
        Core Engineering Team
      </h2>
      <p class="text-base text-[#9ca3af] max-w-2xl">
        Các kỹ sư trực tiếp thiết kế kiến trúc, phát triển thuật toán và xây dựng hạ tầng tự chủ cho mọi sản phẩm tại 529 Studio.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
      
      <!-- Developer 1: Vu Thanh Dat -->
      <div class="bg-[#0d111a] border border-[#1a2233] hover:border-[#2a354d] transition-all rounded-xl p-6 sm:p-8 flex flex-col justify-between group">
        <div>
          <!-- Header -->
          <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 mb-4">
            <div>
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-1">
                <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[10px] font-bold mono bg-[#38bdf8]/10 text-[#38bdf8] border border-[#38bdf8]/30">
                  SYSTEM ARCHITECT
                </span>
                <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[10px] font-bold mono bg-[#22c55e]/10 text-[#22c55e] border border-[#22c55e]/30">
                  AI &amp; FULL-STACK
                </span>
              </div>
              <h3 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight">
                Vu Thanh Dat
              </h3>
              <div class="text-xs mono text-[#9ca3af] mt-0.5">@thdat-vu</div>
            </div>

            <a
              href="https://github.com/thdat-vu"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-xs font-semibold mono bg-[#111622] text-white border border-[#2a354d] hover:border-[#38bdf8] hover:bg-[#161c2b] transition-all"
            >
              <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 fill-current" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 0C5.37 0 0 5.37 0 12c0 5.31 3.435 9.795 8.205 11.385.6.105.825-.255.825-.57 0-.285-.015-1.23-.015-2.235-3.015.555-3.795-.735-4.035-1.41-.135-.345-.72-1.41-1.23-1.695-.42-.225-1.02-.78-.015-.795.945-.015 1.62.87 1.845 1.23 1.08 1.815 2.805 1.305 3.495.99.105-.78.42-1.305.765-1.605-2.67-.3-5.46-1.335-5.46-5.925 0-1.305.465-2.385 1.23-3.225-.12-.3-.54-1.53.12-3.18 0 0 1.005-.315 3.3 1.23.96-.27 1.98-.405 3-.405s2.04.135 3 .405c2.295-1.56 3.3-1.23 3.3-1.23.66 1.65.24 2.88.12 3.18.765.84 1.23 1.905 1.23 3.225 0 4.605-2.805 5.625-5.475 5.925.435.375.81 1.095.81 2.22 0 1.605-.015 2.895-.015 3.3 0 .315.225.69.825.57A12.02 12.02 0 0024 12c0-6.63-5.37-12-12-12z"/></svg>
              <span>GitHub ↗</span>
            </a>
          </div>

          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#9ca3af] leading-relaxed mb-6">
            Chịu trách nhiệm thiết kế kiến trúc hệ thống, phát triển backend hiệu năng cao, tích hợp suy luận AI (Computer Vision &amp; LLM), và xây dựng các giao diện web phức tạp.
          </p>

          <!-- Core Specializations -->
          <div class="space-y-2 mb-6">
            <div class="text-xs mono font-bold uppercase text-[#cbd5e1] tracking-wider mb-2">Trọng Tâm Đóng Góp:</div>
            <div class="text-xs mono text-[#9ca3af] flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-[#38bdf8] font-bold">•</span>
              <span><strong>System &amp; Application Architecture:</strong> Thiết kế kiến trúc tổng thể Warded (projectKV) và F1 Virtual Engineer.</span>
            </div>
            <div class="text-xs mono text-[#9ca3af] flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-[#38bdf8] font-bold">•</span>
              <span><strong>AI &amp; Computer Vision:</strong> Tối ưu hóa suy luận OpenVINO YOLOv8n p50 16ms, tích hợp Gemini LLM reasoning và FastF1 telemetry.</span>
            </div>
            <div class="text-xs mono text-[#9ca3af] flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-[#38bdf8] font-bold">•</span>
              <span><strong>Full-Stack &amp; Spatial:</strong> Lập trình Golang Gin API, bản đồ không gian Uber H3, Next.js SSR và công cụ dán nhãn dữ liệu nhóm.</span>
            </div>
            <div class="text-xs mono text-[#9ca3af] flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-[#38bdf8] font-bold">•</span>
              <span><strong>Code Quality &amp; Hardening:</strong> Vá 18+ điểm bảo mật, quản lý PR review, thiết lập linter và timeout guardrails.</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Tech Badges -->
        <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 flex-wrap text-[11px] mono text-[#9ca3af] pt-4 border-t border-[#1a2233]">
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-[#161c2b] text-[#cbd5e1]">Golang</span>
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-[#161c2b] text-[#cbd5e1]">Python</span>
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-[#161c2b] text-[#cbd5e1]">OpenVINO</span>
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-[#161c2b] text-[#cbd5e1]">YOLOv8</span>
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-[#161c2b] text-[#cbd5e1]">Gemini API</span>
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-[#161c2b] text-[#cbd5e1]">Next.js</span>
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-[#161c2b] text-[#cbd5e1]">FastAPI</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Developer 2: Doan Quoc Giang -->
      <div class="bg-[#0d111a] border border-[#1a2233] hover:border-[#2a354d] transition-all rounded-xl p-6 sm:p-8 flex flex-col justify-between group">
        <div>
          <!-- Header -->
          <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 mb-4">
            <div>
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-1">
                <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[10px] font-bold mono bg-[#a855f7]/10 text-[#a855f7] border border-[#a855f7]/30">
                  LEAD INFRASTRUCTURE
                </span>
                <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[10px] font-bold mono bg-[#22c55e]/10 text-[#22c55e] border border-[#22c55e]/30">
                  DEVSECOPS &amp; SRE
                </span>
              </div>
              <h3 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight">
                Dam Quang Giang
              </h3>
              <div class="text-xs mono text-[#9ca3af] mt-0.5">@giangdq202</div>
            </div>

            <a
              href="https://github.com/giangdq202"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-xs font-semibold mono bg-[#111622] text-white border border-[#2a354d] hover:border-[#a855f7] hover:bg-[#161c2b] transition-all"
            >
              <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 fill-current" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 0C5.37 0 0 5.37 0 12c0 5.31 3.435 9.795 8.205 11.385.6.105.825-.255.825-.57 0-.285-.015-1.23-.015-2.235-3.015.555-3.795-.735-4.035-1.41-.135-.345-.72-1.41-1.23-1.695-.42-.225-1.02-.78-.015-.795.945-.015 1.62.87 1.845 1.23 1.08 1.815 2.805 1.305 3.495.99.105-.78.42-1.305.765-1.605-2.67-.3-5.46-1.335-5.46-5.925 0-1.305.465-2.385 1.23-3.225-.12-.3-.54-1.53.12-3.18 0 0 1.005-.315 3.3 1.23.96-.27 1.98-.405 3-.405s2.04.135 3 .405c2.295-1.56 3.3-1.23 3.3-1.23.66 1.65.24 2.88.12 3.18.765.84 1.23 1.905 1.23 3.225 0 4.605-2.805 5.625-5.475 5.925.435.375.81 1.095.81 2.22 0 1.605-.015 2.895-.015 3.3 0 .315.225.69.825.57A12.02 12.02 0 0024 12c0-6.63-5.37-12-12-12z"/></svg>
              <span>GitHub ↗</span>
            </a>
          </div>

          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#9ca3af] leading-relaxed mb-6">
            Chịu trách nhiệm thiết kế, triển khai và vận hành toàn bộ hạ tầng máy chủ tự lưu trữ 24/7, mạng lưới Zero-Trust Ingress, tự động hóa cảnh báo và tối ưu hóa tài nguyên phần cứng.
          </p>

          <!-- Core Specializations -->
          <div class="space-y-2 mb-6">
            <div class="text-xs mono font-bold uppercase text-[#cbd5e1] tracking-wider mb-2">Trọng Tâm Đóng Góp:</div>
            <div class="text-xs mono text-[#9ca3af] flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-[#a855f7] font-bold">•</span>
              <span><strong>Edge Ingress &amp; Zero-NAT Security:</strong> Thiết lập Cloudflare Argo Tunnel, Cloudflare Pages Edge, Traefik v3 ACME DNS-01 Let's Encrypt Wildcard.</span>
            </div>
            <div class="text-xs mono text-[#9ca3af] flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-[#a855f7] font-bold">•</span>
              <span><strong>Mesh Networking:</strong> Thiết lập mạng riêng ảo Tailscale WireGuard kết nối bảo mật giữa Master Ingress và AI Compute Node.</span>
            </div>
            <div class="text-xs mono text-[#9ca3af] flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-[#a855f7] font-bold">•</span>
              <span><strong>Low-Spec Hardware Engineering:</strong> Tối ưu hóa cgroups limits, nén RAM swap qua zram, và thuật toán bảo vệ ổ đĩa cơ HDD 5400 RPM.</span>
            </div>
            <div class="text-xs mono text-[#9ca3af] flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-[#a855f7] font-bold">•</span>
              <span><strong>Alerting &amp; SRE Automation:</strong> n8n Alert Gateway tập trung phân luồng Telegram Topic, giám sát Dead-Letter Queue và sao lưu mã hóa Cloudflare R2.</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Tech Badges -->
        <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 flex-wrap text-[11px] mono text-[#9ca3af] pt-4 border-t border-[#1a2233]">
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-[#161c2b] text-[#cbd5e1]">Docker Compose</span>
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-[#161c2b] text-[#cbd5e1]">Traefik v3</span>
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-[#161c2b] text-[#cbd5e1]">Cloudflare Argo</span>
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-[#161c2b] text-[#cbd5e1]">Tailscale</span>
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-[#161c2b] text-[#cbd5e1]">n8n Automation</span>
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-[#161c2b] text-[#cbd5e1]">Debian GNU/Linux</span>
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-[#161c2b] text-[#cbd5e1]">Cloudflare R2</span>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
